  "term": "psychic",
  "definition": "In this source, psychic refers to a proposed non-material, informational aspect of consciousness that exists in a universal non-local field and interacts with the brain. It describes mental or conscious phenomena as rooted in this psychic-informational domain rather than being produced solely by brain activity.",
